### Debug trace

Set `MEITOU_{{ mod_slug | replace('-', '_') | upper }}_DEBUG=1` before launching Meitou. The mod writes transition lines to Meitou's `log.txt` prefixed for this mod. It never posts player-facing diagnostic messages.

